n search of a home. While passing through a distant galaxy, he was forced to land when his ship's fuel cells ran dry. Now stranded in a far away world, Curtains must find fuel for his ship and return to space... or perhaps another way to continue his journey?", "summary": "Curtains The Clown is a compact 2D adventure with multiple possible outcomes. Use simple platforming mechanics like wall jumps and double jumping to guide Curtains through a treacherous world in search of a way to continue (or end) his journey. Hidden away in seemingly unreachable places are 6 items that hold the keys to various exits. Find and bring an item to its corresponding NPC/world object to discover what fate will become of our clown friend.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/curtains-the-clown", "videos": [{"id": 164375, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "NGk_1ldyD4o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NGk_1ldyD4o", "title": "Curtains The Clown official trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NGk_1ldyD4o/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164376, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "wt7XRetLqrk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wt7XRetLqrk", "title": "Curtains the Clown Gameplay Trailer - The Welkin Run", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wt7XRetLqrk/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}